# Build context of the decryption image (`image/Dockerfile`, built from this
# directory). Allowlist: only the files that the image needs, so that local
# files (e.g., `.env` files, virtual environments, caches) stay out of it
*
!image/requirements.txt
!src/foca_plugins/tes/data/crypt4gh/decrypt.py

# Never local environment files, also if the allowlist grows
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
